                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Note: Recieved Key from the Developer/Publisher\n\nAncient Worlds: Jaguar's fate is a pretty simple game. You play as a warchief. You just click on your home area.Then on the places you wanna go an attack. In my play of the game it was pretty easy to get to the next city. Got 3 stars on every battle.It crashed on me after few cities. Looking back I would only recommend Ancient Worlds Jaguar's Fate if your looking for a cheap time killer or something to let your kids play when they wanna play a game on the pc that is kid friendly,sort of. Check out my gameplay here:\n\nhttps://youtu.be/gfRc-C_sQhw",
